    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University and UNICEF, Afghanistan are working together to overcome obstacles that poverty, violence, disease and discrimination place in a child's path. As a part of this cooperation, the university recently conducted the first ever one day training session on Lives Saved Tool (LiST) in Kabul.",
